<section id="why-reboot" class="py-20 lg:py-28" style="background:#0F2044">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold mb-5 text-white">Why Senior Leaders Choose Reboot</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">The traditional consulting model was built for a world of generalists and bench capacity. AI transformation requires specialists, accountability, and genuine executive engagement — from Day 1.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-7 border border-white/20">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-white">We Don't Start by Doing AI.</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-100 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every other firm starts by proposing AI tools and pilots. We start by understanding your business — your workflows, your data, your people, your competitive situation. Then we figure out where AI actually creates value.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-7 border border-white/20">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-white">Purpose-Built Teams. Not Whatever's Available.</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-100 text-sm leading-relaxed">When McKinsey or Deloitte staff your engagement, they pull from whoever's available on their bench. Reboot builds your team from scratch — selecting the best-in-class specialist for each dimension of your challenge.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-7 border border-white/20">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-white">Operator-Led. Not Theorist-Led.</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-100 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every Reboot principal has run something: a P&L, an engineering organization, a product team, a finance function. We know what it takes to make decisions stick, because we've been in the room where the decisions are made.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-7 border border-white/20">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-white">One Engagement. Comprehensive Coverage.</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-100 text-sm leading-relaxed">Hiring five agencies means five discovery processes and five sets of recommendations that don't align. Reboot provides a single executive-level view across all dimensions of your AI challenge.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-7 border border-white/20">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-white">Strategic Oversight. Real Accountability.</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-100 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every Reboot engagement has a named senior principal accountable for outcomes from Day 1. Not a project manager. Not a steering committee. A principal with skin in the game who owns the result.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-xl p-7 border border-white/20">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-3 text-white">We Stay Agile by Being Selective.</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-100 text-sm leading-relaxed">We work with a limited number of clients at any given time. It means every client gets genuine senior attention. No bait-and-switch. No partner who disappears after the kickoff.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-8 text-center border-2 border-white/30 bg-white/5">
      <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white">"The question isn't whether to pursue AI transformation — the question is whether you'll have access to the team that can actually execute it."</p>
      <p class="text-slate-300 mt-4">— Reboot Ventures</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
